sequenceDiagram
    participant U as Customer
    participant C as Checkout
    participant I as Inventory
    participant P as Payment
    participant O as Order
    participant S as Support

    U->>C: Place Order
    C->>I: Check / Reserve Inventory
    I-->>C: Delayed / Queued
    C->>P: Authorize Payment
    P-->>C: Delayed / Queued
    U->>C: Click Again / Retry
    C->>C: Duplicate Request Pressure
    C->>O: Pending or Confirm?
    C-->>U: Pending State Needed
    U->>S: Contact Support
